window.products.push({"id":598018,"name":"gohantee 4-Blade Stove Fan Heat Powered Fireplace Fan for Wood/Log Burner/Fireplace/Pellet Circulating Warm Air Silent, Saving Fuel Eco-Friendly and E","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614ySzV5FrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[HEAT POWERED] Upgraded 4 blades stove fan design, no batteries or electricity required. The stove fan generates its own power by the heat from the stove surface. The fireplace fan can convert heat energy into kinetic energy of the engine, then drive the rotation of the baldes. The stove fan is very useful for gas stove, electric stove, pellet stove or wood burning stove, catalytic stove and non-catalytic stove. [EFFICIENT AND ECO-FRIENDLY] The heat activated fan can produce more warm air and improve the efficiency of the product. The fireplace fan can improve hot air circulation, quickly disperses hot air throughout the room, no need to sit so close to the stove. More efficient use of the heat from the furnace, reduce wood consumption, produce more hot air and environmentally friendly. [SILENT OPERATION] The fireplace fans heat operated only moving part is the blade assembly, quiet and low noise generate. Great for a cozy living space, you can enjoy the warm air in a quiet and comfortable environment. [OPERATING TEMPERATURE] The wood stove fan starts to rotate when the temperature reaches 50℃. The working temperature of the fan is 122°F - 662°F (50°C - 350°C).Recommended surface temperature is between 392°F - 644°F(200-340°C). The maximum temperature should not exceed 350°C, otherwise the fan and parts may be damaged. The temperature of the fireplace affects the speed of the fan. [OVERHEATING PROTECTION] The material is anodized aluminum, wear-resistant and anti-rust. The in-built bi-metallic strip at the base of the stove fan is designed to raise the edge of the fan slightly and reduce the contact area of the heat source as the maximum operating temperature is approached to protect the motor and the moelectric module. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we will answer you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614ySzV5FrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"gohantee","source_asin":"B096XJDD2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096XJDD2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096XJDD2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
