window.products.push({"id":598098,"name":"Espresso Cups with Saucers Set, 3 Ounces Porcelain Coffee Cups with Metal Stand and Spoons, Ceramic Cappuccino Coffee Cups Demitasse Cups for Espresso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bG-LUWU+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Start your day with a lovely cup of espresso. Each espresso coffee cup holds 3 OZ. and works great with an espresso machine. Enjoy your coffee! The porcelain espresso cups and saucers set is ideal for that morning single-shot or double shot of espresso, or to enjoy an afternoon Turkish coffee. The coffee cups and saucers are specifically designed for enjoying espresso, coffee, or any beverage. The ceramic cappuccino coffee cups set is made of high-grade porcelain, are dishwasher, microwave, and oven safe. This white classic coffee cup with saucer and stirring spoon is perfect for improving the quality of your daily coffee time. Keeping a neat and clean kitchen will make you feel good! The stackable coffee cup set with a stand is a great idea. This means that your espresso cup and saucer sets can be stored away nicely, keeping things neat and tidy while taking up less cupboard space. Furthermore, you can move them around easily. The demitasse cup has a delicate handle that your fingers can easily fit through for easy access. The saucer easily holds your coffee cup, coffee scoop, or sugar packet. Perfect for everyday use: breakfast, dessert time, tea time. If the espresso cup set is incomplete or damaged, or if you are not 100% satisfied with the coffee cups, please do not hesitate to contact us and we will try our best to find a satisfactory solution for you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bG-LUWU+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LYEOBOH","source_asin":"B0C1B92BSC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1B92BSC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1B92BSC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":598099,"name":"Kitchen Decor - Oven Mitts - Towel Linen Set (5 Pc) Thankful Grateful and Blessed is The Sentimental Message of Gratitude - Kitchen Towel Potholders S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mgBzEtLrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your hands safe and your spirits high! Remember that life is about enjoying each and every moment! These Home Collection kitchen linens are a great reminder that life is precious while showing gratitude and also keeping things clean and safe in the kitchen and will also add a warm, cozy, sentimental touch to any kitchen layout. Deck out your kitchen with an artful Thankful Grateful Blessed squares! Large and absorbent 15x25-in. cotton/polyester kitchen towels are perfect for drying dishes and keeping work spaces clean. Pairs perfectly with our other Sentimental themed kitchen linens. Add a touch of fun to your kitchen décor with these TWO graphic print oven mitts! Home Collection oven mitts will help protect your hands from dangerous burns and keep your kitchen stylish in the process. Each 13-in. mitt is decorated with bright squares and a printed Thankful Grateful and Blessed message and pairs perfectly with our other grateful themed kitchen linens. Plus, oven mitts are generously sized, so almost every hand will fit. TWO Thick cotton-quilted pot holders are a staple of every busy kitchen! Cotton fabric is quilted for extra durability and each 7-in. pot holder has a solid brown back and stitched-in hang loop for easy storage. They pair perfectly with the rest of our family graditude themed kitchen linens. Each pack includes 2 Home Collection brown and tan Pot Holders. FIVE Piece Bundle Includes: Two Oven Mitts Two Oven Mitts One Dish Towel One Dish Towel Two Pack Pot Holders  Necessity for any busy kitchen! Durable enough for multiple uses but soft enough for delicate surfaces. Perfect for cleaning up spills, dusting, polishing, washing dishes, and more. Two Pack Pot Holders Necessity for any busy kitchen! Durable enough for multiple uses but soft enough for delicate surfaces. Perfect for cleaning up spills, dusting, polishing, washing dishes, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mgBzEtLrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"greenbier","source_asin":"B085272QMQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085272QMQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085272QMQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
