window.products.push({"id":598125,"name":"HONORED TRADITION Food Fermentation 6 Weights, Stainless Steel LIDS, and AIRLOCK for Fermented Probiotic Foods. Fits Wide Mouth Mason Jars.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wCuYTyGeL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT GIFT OR STARTER KIT – This kit makes the perfect gift for anyone that enjoys fermenting foods or anyone that has wanted to start fermenting foods. Kit includes Air Locks, Lids, and Grommets and glass weights to help you start fermenting your way to excellent health Wide mouth jars are not included. FERMENTED FOODS AND PROBIOTICS – Adding fermented foods to your diet may benefit your overall well-being. Fermentation promotes the growth of beneficial bacteria, known as probiotics. Probiotics have been shown to improve immune function as well as digestive and heart health. Common fermented foods include kimchi, sauerkraut, olives, kefir, tempeh, kombucha, peppers, asparagus, green beans, carrots, and pickles to name just a few. 4 GLASS WEIGHTS – Fits any wide mouth mason jar and helps pack vegetables tightly below the brine. Easy to clean and food safe. 4 Airlocks,8 Grommets and 4 Lids– Allows gas to escape and keeps contaminants out. Easy to clean and food safe. Fits any wide mouth jars. LOWEST PRICE – We manufacture only high-quality product at a low cost for you. We guarantee each kit or your money back.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wCuYTyGeL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honored Tradition","source_asin":"B081J523JL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598125","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081J523JL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081J523JL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
