window.products.push({"id":598188,"name":"Sunrise Alarm Clock Wake Up Light with FM Radio Simulated Sunrise Touch-Changed 5 Color Dynamic Atmosphere Light 6 Natural Sounds 7 Color Sleep Breath","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711vlqA0ohL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Alarm Clock with Sunrise Simulation】This alarm clock gradually simulates a sunrise, gradually waking you up with a natural and pleasant brightness within 5-60 minutes before the alarm time. Wake Up Light also offers a choice of 6 alarm sounds, as well as touch controls for lighting adjustments and a snooze function. 【Touch Control Multi-Color】The sunrise alarm clock illuminates your space with a soft and warm glow. Color select feature lets you automatically cycle through seven different light colors, or choose your favorite from white, red, yellow, green, blue, indigo and purple LED colors with just one touch Fit any decor, occasion or mood. 【10 Soothing Sounds】Personalize your sleep routine by adjusting the light mode and intensity and soothing sounds (wind, rain, light music, water flow, lullaby), gently help you relax before falling asleep. 8-inch widescreen LED digital multi-function display, which can display time, day, month, week/day at the same time, while keeping the time constant, day of the week and temperature/day of the week and radio frequency, etc. 【Perfect Lighting Effect】Can be used as a reading light/night light/atmosphere light/wake-up light, simulating sunrise and sunset. You can also enter the ambient light mode, choose your favorite color or dynamic lighting effect, and easily create the ambience effect you need. 【Special Gift】This lightweight sunrise alarm clock is small and multifunctional, practical and thoughtful, a perfect choice for anyone you love, especially for kids and girls and boys aged 10-16. We provide 24-month worry-free product backup and lifetime friendly customer support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711vlqA0ohL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EZ.winpow","source_asin":"B0BF16FKJP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598188","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF16FKJP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF16FKJP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":598189,"name":"Lamson Hamburger Turner, Stainless Steel, with Riveted Walnut Handle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ssFjFkLyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lamson cutlery, kitchen tools and trade tools are still handcrafted in Massachusetts by American workers. We are proud to say that after 179 years, Lamson still produces the finest cutlery, kitchen tools and trade tools made in America that aim at nothing short of perfection. Lamson was established in Shelburne Falls, Massachusetts in 1837. As one of the oldest cutlery manufacturers in the United States, Lamson has been the choice of home and professional cooks as well as US Presidents for the last 179 years because of its high standard of craftsmanship. These traditions are true today not only in our cutlery and kitchen tools but in our barbeque equipment, TreeSpirit (Handcrafted North American Hardwood Kitchen Utensils and Wood Care Products) and HotSpot ( Professional Grade Silicone Potholders, Trivets, HotHandles) products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ssFjFkLyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lamson","source_asin":"B000RUUMYC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000RUUMYC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000RUUMYC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
