window.products.push({"id":598199,"name":"Classic Brands Mornington White Metal Bed Frame with Headboard, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":141.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OTst9OycL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Design your modern farmhouse or French country style bedroom with our metal bed frame. Inspired by geometric shapes, this bed’s headboard and footboard combines an interconnecting pattern to create an eye-catching focal point for your bedroom. Super lightweight framing, side rails and support legs guarantee stability and durability. Metal slats provide further support and stability to the body and mattress and a box spring is optional. Plus, the bed frame offers a 10.5-inch clearance to the floor and provides space below for stowing shallow bins, shoes, or toys. Available in black or white, this bed coordinates with any bedding set or room’s color scheme. Assembly and setup is extremely easy, just fold out and snap together.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OTst9OycL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic Brands","source_asin":"B09FGKCPYV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FGKCPYV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FGKCPYV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":598200,"name":"Bormioli Rocco Plate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eOoaal6eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The fine tradition of the Bormioli Rocco Group coincides with the very history of glass: the first glassworks was established in Parma in 1825. The company has always demonstrated a great drive to pioneer innovation: in machinery, materials and design. Over the years it has developed a special talent, that of combining time-honored craftsmanship and the passion of master glassmakers with modern industrial processes. Bormioli Rocco is the leading company in its sector in Italy and a great ambassador of the Made in Italy label on international markets. Respect for tradition, passion for good taste and constant research and innovation are Bormioli Rocco's milestones to create products that meet the needs of the consumers. For Bormioli Rocco the respect for the environment; it's a must so its entire manufacturing process is oriented towards a mission of social and environmental responsibility. This dinner plate is part of the Prometeo collection, unique and precious because it features sinuous lines and a sophisticated material texture. Made in tempered opal glass, the Prometeo dinner plate features, like the other products in the collection, an external texture that gives a feeling of artistic authenticity. The dinner plate is ideal for serving second or main courses: it can be combined with the soup plate and the dessert plate of the same the collection for a classic but impressive mise en place. The dinner plate is microwave safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eOoaal6eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bormioli Rocco","source_asin":"B07D4X6V5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D4X6V5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D4X6V5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
