window.products.push({"id":598274,"name":"Yeaban Chenille Bathroom Rugs Non-Slip Thick Plush Bath Mat - Absorbent Washable Bath Rugs for Bathroom Shower Sink Carpet (Black, 24\" x 17\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WsKntmw7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Super Soft, Luxury Enjoyment] The bathroom rug is made of plump thick plush chenille, with 1.18\" long fiber. Wherever you put it, it can well protect your body from the stimulation of the cold floor, to prevent a cold. For example, when you come out of the bathroom or bathtub after taking a bath, or you want to sit on the ground, or your baby or pet wants to lie on the ground, it provides you and your family with a more comfortable life [Anti-slip, Safer] With non-slip texture TPR bottom, the bath mat back clings to slippery floor to stay put. Whether after shower, or getting ready in front of the sink, you don't have to worry about slipping. If there are older adults or children, it will greatly ensure and improve their safety in the washroom. **Place the mat on Clean Dry Floor only. Keep the bottom of the mat dry and clean to avoid possible slippage. Before using, test with foot to ensure it doesn't move** [Ultra Absorbent, Cleaner] There will always be more or less water left on the floor next to the sink, bathtub and bathroom door at home, which is neither safe nor tidy. With this chenille bath rug, it can instantly absorb the water falling on it and keep the floor dry. You no longer have to mop the floor all the time [Machine Washable & Dry, Durable] It’s effortless to clean this bathroom mat. Just put it in a laundry bag, throw it into the washer with cold water and the drier with low heat setting, or hang or lay flat to dry. The color keeps vibrant even after many years of washes and drying. No need to worry about getting the fibers off with its excellent material and workmanship [Strong Practicability, Vibrant Decor] This non-slip bath rug/mat is suitable for any place that you want it to be dry or clean, like tub-side, the front of water sinks, bathroom, washroom, kitchen, entryway, or any other places in your home where you want to make relaxed contact with the floor, like living room, bedroom. Its fluffy appearance with multiple colors and sizes also decorates your room with comfort. It’s great for home, hotel, etc","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WsKntmw7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yeaban","source_asin":"B09KLMVFQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KLMVFQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KLMVFQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
