window.products.push({"id":598324,"name":"Deluxe Comfort Microbead Log Pillow (14\" x 7\") – Airy Squishy Soft Microbeads – Stress and Neck Tension Relief – Rustic Wood Log Style – Neck Pillow, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DbYOKNAcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Larger Squishy Support Pillow Leads to an Even Sweeter Sleep! It doesn't seem to matter how you position yourself at night, or how many different kinds of pillows you try, you know you're going to wake up with a sore or stiff neck. You are aware of the fact that you need a new pillow. But what pillow could there possibly be that you haven't already tried? You know you need something that is pliable, and that molds to the shape of your head and your neck. What you need is the microbead moshi log pillow from Deluxe Comfort. Filled with hundreds of thousands of moshi micro beads, this pillow easily takes the shape of your head and neck in a firmer and more supportive way than even most memory foam pillows. It offers superior support for your head and neck, so you wake up feeling refreshed and ready to take on the day, instead of exhausted and pained. If you like our moshi microbead pillow, you'll LOVE our larger and even more comfy moshi microbead log pillow! Although larger than our regular moshi microbead pillow, it is still relatively small and lightweight, making it still an excellent pillow to take with you anywhere you go. The moshi log pillow is the perfect accessory to take when you travel on a long trip. Whether by train, plane, or automobile, this comfortable pillow will make you forget to ask \"Are we there yet?\" Always forgetting it at home? No problem! Keep one pillow at home and one in the car; these pillows are affordable enough to have several. GET YOURS before they sell out!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DbYOKNAcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deluxe Comfort","source_asin":"B07QD6SKK4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598324","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QD6SKK4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QD6SKK4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":598325,"name":"Miyabi Mizu SG2 9.5\" Slicing Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RdZRCkJOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Miyabi celebrates Japanese craftsmanship with the Mizu SG2 Slicing Knife. Using traditional methods and innovative techniques, these knives merge the past and present into one exceptional knife collection. The SG2 micro-carbide powder stainless steel core is wrapped in another layer of stainless steel with a hammered (\"Tsuchime\") Damascus finish. The Cryodur heat treatment process results in a blade with a high Rockwell Hardness rating of 63, providing superior edge retention, corrosion resistance and blade flexibility. Miyabi artisans then perform the Honbazuke sharpening method that originated from traditional Japanese sword making. This 3-step process includes sharpening the blades twice on whetstones, followed by mirror polishing on a leather wheel. Used over 1000 years ago for samurai swords, this is what gives these knives their signature Miyabi razor sharpness. The meticulously crafted blade is then accompanied by a stunning, comfortable and durable D-shaped Micarta handle and stainless steel bolster. Beautiful accents adorn the handle including a decorative mosaic pin, red spacers, the Miyabi logo engraved on the handle end. Handcrafted in Seki, Japan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RdZRCkJOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIYABI","source_asin":"B00QU8D1IO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QU8D1IO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QU8D1IO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
