window.products.push({"id":598336,"name":"Flamaker Gaming Desk 44 Inch Gaming Table Computer Desk PC Gamer Table T Shape Game Station with Large Carbon Fiber Surface, Cup Holder & Headphone (L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FHc+Ld3WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sturdy & Steady Construction: Gaming tables are mainly designed with T-shaped legs, using harder high-density fiberboard as the desktop, and coating steel frame as the main structure, with the fixed lever and the triangular stability principle, the stability of the table is further improved. This design also makes the appearance of the gaming table look tougher, you don't have to worry about the damage to the table by the small actions you make when you are fully engaged in the e-sports game. Desktop & Full-Surface Mouse Pad: The 43.3\"L x 23.6\"W PVC desktop size can almost meet the display of all sizes, and will not make the space crowded due to the long desktop length, this size of gaming table is suitable for use in gaming houses with privacy. The built-in mouse pad of the gaming table can cover the entire desktop so that you will not have the trouble of dragging the mouse to the surface of the gaming table and causing damage to the mouse and the desktop. Multifunctional Accessories: This gaming table comes with accessories that can perfectly solve the problem of cluttered desktop. You can put the game controller and CDs neatly on the controller rack, the headphone holder and water cup holder are assembled on both sides so that you don't have to worry about the placement of the headphones and the problem of thirsty during gaming, the gaming table also comes with two cable buckles to keep your cables in a consistent direction. Avant-Garde Design: The front side of the gaming table is recessed, allowing you to get closer to the display; the back side is smooth and can fit the wall perfectly. The main color is black, with red tough lines and the pioneer logo on both sides of the table legs. While enhancing the gaming atmosphere, it also makes the appearance of the gaming table more futuristic, The sturdy and stable structure and comfortable experience are all for you to get a better gaming experience. Weight Bearing & Foot Pads: The overall structure is up to 260lbs. The attached four foot pads can not only protect the floor from damage, but also can make slight adjustments to stabilize the entire gaming table when the floor is uneven.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FHc+Ld3WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flamaker","source_asin":"B08F14MRMW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F14MRMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F14MRMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
