window.products.push({"id":598434,"name":"Amici Home Gunmetal Storage Canister Metal Can, 64 Fluid Ounces, Matte Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D9n8KiamL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The gunmetal canister collection by Amici Home are sleek and elegant food storage solutions that add a touch of modernist to your kitchen or home decor. Featuring a textured, hammered finish, each canister has a BPA-free silicone gasket around the lid and an arched handle. This collection comes in 4 nesting sizes, small: 3. 75\" D x 6\" H (9. 6 cm d x 15. 3 cm H) with a Capacity of 20 fluid ounces (0. 6 litters), medium: 4. 5\" D x 7\" H (11. 5 cm d x 17. 8 cm H) with a Capacity of 38 fluid ounces (1. 12 litters), large: 5. 5\" D x 8. 5\" H (14 cm d x 21. 6 cm H) with a Capacity of 64 fluid oz (1. 89 litters), and extra large: 6. 5\" D x 10\" H (16. 5 cm d x 25. 4 cm H) with a Capacity of 104 fluid ounces (3 liters). these metal canisters should be hand washed to preserve their look and functionality. about Amici homeglobal Amici was founded in 1982 in Southern California to design and distribute fine housewares products across the United States to all types of retail Businesses. In 2016, global Amici rebranded and is now called Amici Home. Amici Home puts an emphasis on providing great customer service, specializing in glass drinkware and storage. Amici Home has recently expanded their assortment by offering metal canisters, ceramic items, pantry staples, and pet products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D9n8KiamL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amici Home","source_asin":"B07N6YCGSX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N6YCGSX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N6YCGSX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
