window.products.push({"id":598466,"name":"We're All Mad Here - Tea and Cakes Scented Soy Candle - Alice in Wonderland Gift 4oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61opRjOCy9L._SL1071_.jpg","description":"Fragrance notes: tea and cakes This fragrance is inspired by the many fantastical and wacky Wonderland characters. The scent name is a nod to the Cheshire Cat’s proclamation to Alice that everyone in Wonderland is mad. The fragrance itself is inspired by the Mad Tea Party, where all guests are, of course, completely mad! The menu consists of a freshly brewed cup of Earl Gray, with its smooth blend of black tea infused with the lemony-orange flavor of bergamot, paired with deliciously decadent almond cake, all rolled up into a single fragrance. As Alice said, “this is getting curiouser and curiouser.\" Indeed. Don’t be late for this tea party. If you’re curious enough to eat the peculiar food labeled with the instructions of ‘Eat Me’ or ‘Drink Me,’ than you are quite mad enough to enjoy this fragrance!  OVERVIEW: ► 4 oz soy candle in a classic round jar ► Gift box included ► $1 from each candle sold supports wolf conservation ► Hand poured with care in small batches ► Perfectly scented with essential oil and perfume oil blends ► Hand blended with these simple ingredients: natural soy wax, cotton wick, premium fragrances, magic ► Vegan candle that contains no dyes, parabens, phthalates, or other toxins ► 25-30 hour burn time when following proper candle care  ► I stand by my products. If for any reason you are not satisfied please send me a message. - Harmony (Old Soul Artisan founder and candlesmith)  ** TIP: To enjoy your candle longer, we recommend not burning for more than 4 hours at a time and to trim the wick between burns. Let your candle melt pool reach to the sides of the jar each time you burn to ensure an even burn throughout the life of the candle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61opRjOCy9L._SL1071_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Old Soul Artisan","source_asin":"B07RBZQJBN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RBZQJBN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RBZQJBN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
