window.products.push({"id":598572,"name":"Oggi Utensil Crock, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a0Mm5Uj3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Want kitchen accessories that are stylish and functional? OGGI is the way to go. OGGI 's Ceramic Kitchen Utensil Holder is a great addition to your home. This kitchen countertop organizer is big enough to hold a variety of kitchen gadgets; spatulas, tongs, ladles, large spoons, etc. It is the perfect modern organization solution for any kitchen. The ceramic is sturdy, so you do not have to worry about bumping it onto the floor and the finish makes it easy to wipe clean for those messy chefs. This is not simply your average utensil organizer. It is beautifully and thoughtfully crafted to be utilized in multiple ways; place it on the table as a centerpiece vase or even as a bottle chiller if needed. The color options include White, Black, Matte Charcoal, Matte Brick Red, and Matter Dark Blue. The ceramic holder measures 6\" x 7\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a0Mm5Uj3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oggi","source_asin":"B0915PQL7T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0915PQL7T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0915PQL7T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":598573,"name":"Cervical Pillow for Neck and Shoulder Pain Relief Support Memory Foam Pillows for Sleeping Ergonomic Orthopedic Contour Pillow Odorless Bed Pillow for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CWwQQC2ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SAFE AND ODORLESS MEMORY FOAM 】: Its temperature sensing makes the cervical pillow fit perfectly around your neck. The best pillows for neck and shoulder pain are firm enough to hold the head at a healthy angle, yet soft enough to relieve pressure points. The sleep pillow design allows you to transition between positions comfortably. You wake up feeling refreshed and any neck pain you've had will go away over time. 【ERGONOMIC ZONE DESIGN】: The cervical memory foam pillow neck contour is designed to perfectly support and align your head, neck, shoulders and back. Provide your body with natural spine support and scientific cervical traction. Reduces pressure on the cervical spine and spine. Helps you breathe more freely and reduce snoring. You will feel refreshed when you wake up. 【REDUCE NECK AND SHOULDER PAIN 】: Size 24.4x13.4x4.3 in, those with cervical spine problems can sleep on the higher side to provide better support for your head and neck, aligning your neck with the rest of your body maintain proper alignment. The lower side of the other side perfectly fits the shoulder curve and effectively relieves the pressure on the shoulders. This will provide firm support for sleep with amazing comfort and softness. It retains its shape and sturdiness over time. 【BREATHABLE REMOVABLE PILLOWCASE】: The neck pillow has a breathable pillowcase. It is removable, has a zipper and is machine washable. The pillow is made from hypoallergenic cotton and polyester, and its soft, breathable fabric allows air to circulate through the pillow throughout the night. It's gentle on your skin and keeps you cool all night - it stays hygroscopic, keeping you from sweating in comfortable climates. 【No-WORRY PURCHASE EXPERIENCE】: Our ergonomic pillows help reduce neck problems and effectively improve your sleep, so it's definitely a good choice! Considering the many great features it has to offer, we can guarantee you won't be disappointed. In the rare case that you don't like the product, we provide a 100% satisfied solution, if you need any assistance, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CWwQQC2ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FYIN-HONG","source_asin":"B0BLGRCFG6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLGRCFG6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLGRCFG6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
