window.products.push({"id":598676,"name":"Bombilla Brazilian Alpaca Model Pico de Loro (Straw) (Fine)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31GALilQg4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Bombilla Brazilian Alpaca Model Pico de Loro. The Brazilian alpaca has more bronze in its alloy, making it lighter and stronger than the Argentine alpaca. - How to clean your mate Bombilla (straw)? Wash the bombilla after each use. Once a month, do a deep cleaning of the bombilla: soak it in boiling water for 25 minutes with two tablespoons of baking soda. Remove the bombilla and lay it on a clean cloth until it dries on its own. Remove the remnants of yerba with a brush. - How to unclog the Bombilla (straw)? We suggest once a month, immerse the bombilla in boiling water for 30 minutes , with two tablespoons of baking soda. Then clean well with a brush to make sure that there is no residue. If the bombilla is removable, brush each element well and blow to check that it has been uncovered. - How to prevent the Bombilla (straw) from clogging? When preparing the mate, it is essential to mix the yerba well : cover the mate with your hand and shake vigorously to achieve a homogeneous mixture (not to remove the dust), but to ensure that all the components (stick, powder and leaves) are well mixed. If we do not shake the mixture well, it is more likely that the bombilla will clog. It is not advisable to use filters on the bombilla neither to remove dust","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31GALilQg4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Migrant Society","source_asin":"B08XJVXLBY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XJVXLBY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XJVXLBY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
