window.products.push({"id":598690,"name":"Omega CNC80S Cold Press Juicer Machine, Vegetable and Fruit Juice Extractor and Nutrition System, Triple-Stage Slow Masticating Juicer, 200 W, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P9esmItKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Omega CNC80S Nutrition System is a masticating juicer machine. Sometimes referred to as a low-speed juicer, the Nutrition Center processes at 80 RPM, whereas most other juice extractor machines process at a speed of 1,650 to 15,000 RPM. The low-speed protects and maintains healthy enzymes, prevents oxidation, and allows juice to be stored for longer periods without degradation. One of the most effective ways to easily access nutritious enzymes that help to improve immunity and overall health, Omega Juicer Machines are designed to deliver a potent dose of antioxidants to boost and support overall health and immunity. Don't eat your fruits and veggies—juice them and enjoy a day’s worth of vitamins in 1 delicious drink! The triple-stage juice processing system extracts the maximum amount of juice from fruits, vegetables, leafy greens and even wheatgrass! You can also use your Omega low-speed juicer to turn nuts into nut butters, make baby food from natural, fresh ingredients, whip up soy milk, extrude pasta, grind coffee and spices, and mince herbs and garlic. Make delicious and nutritious drinks and snacks that everyone will love with the help of this slow juicer cold press machine. Note: some noise is to be expected. Please set this compact juicer machine on top of a thin towel to help stabilize and mitigate noise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P9esmItKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Omega","source_asin":"B01FU8Y6TW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FU8Y6TW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FU8Y6TW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":598691,"name":"Springdale Springtime Hand Painted Porcelain Jar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c5G21qMuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our springtime Series features cheerful yellow and orange Daffodil blossoms and greenery hand-painted on beige porcelain with amber accents. The Daffodil pattern runs along the Circumference of this adorable little jar. A perfect place to tuck away treasures, it becomes a wide mouth decorative vase when the lid is removed. It is a beautiful addition to a curio shelf or accent table and makes a wonderful little gift for any occasion. Dale Tiffany, Inc. Is the world's foremost developer of Tiffany, crystal, art glass lighting and accessory products. From its inception, Dale Tiffany has searched for colors and finishes that are truly unique to the art of fine handmade glass. Carefully over the past decades, Dale Tiffany has developed a myriad collection of products featuring the subtle and vibrant colors of hand-made art glass.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81c5G21qMuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dale Tiffany Lamps","source_asin":"B07452HDZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598691","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07452HDZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07452HDZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
