window.products.push({"id":598958,"name":"Fair Trade Zulu Telephone Wire Small Triangle Basket, Silver Sea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C7dSW9MfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Combining a modern-day material with traditional weaving techniques, talented Zulu makers living in rural South Africa create these beautiful baskets by hand. This fusion of past and present enables more than 500 Zulu families to gain the dignity of work and self-sufficiency. Bridge for Africa, a 501(c)(3) non-profit organization, is a well-established and respected provider of fine contemporary crafts to the American market. They pay their artist partners a living wage, promote sustainable development in Africa, and educate consumers in the U.S. about the benefits of Fair Trade as a method to fight poverty in the developing world. Your purchase of a Bridge for Africa product will bring a unique beauty to your home while advancing hope for future generations of African artisans.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C7dSW9MfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bridge for Africa","source_asin":"B075M8BM12","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075M8BM12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075M8BM12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":598959,"name":"Humidifier for Bedroom Top-Filling - Oil Box - Cool Mist - Whisper Quiet Ultrasonic Air Humidifier, Large Room, Baby, Kids, Home, Office 36H Humidifyi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718G7m+0siL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BIG CAPACITY / SMART HUMIDIFICATION: Ultrasonic cool mist humidifiers for bedroom feature an advanced humidification system, air ionization, aroma diffuser & air filter. The large humidifier ( 3L capacity) works for rooms up to 377sq. ft. At the lowest speed, it will last up to 36 hours at one refill. The advanced humidification system includes 2 types of humidity regulation: 3 levels of mist output & a constant humidity level. Use one-touch button controls to reach the perfect humidity! TOP FILLING / LEAKPROOF / EASY CLEAN: The extra-wide opening and top filling construction of this large room humidifier provide for hassle-free refilling and fast easy cleaning. Get ready to spend no more than 1 minute of your precious time to refill this cool mist humidifier. Moreover, regular maintenance will require minimum effort. The device will not leak and is guaranteed to provide long term service thanks to its reliable top fill construction. AIR IONIZATION / AIR FILTER / AROMA BOX: Air ionization function generates over 300 million ions in one minute to safeguard your family's health. Activated air filter emits silver ions (Ag+) purify indoor air. The inbuilt aroma box is an added bonus. The air humidifier with essential oils has a healing effect on your mind and body, reducing stress & boosting your energy. Aromа oils promote healthy sleep, relieve headaches, alleviate pain, improve skin conditions, & help treat the common cold. ULTRA QUIET / SLEEP MODE / 8 HOUR TIMER: The whisper-quiet large capacity bedroom humidifier generates a <30dB near-silent frequency and is perfect for kids, babies, seniors & sensitive sleepers. Ultra-quiet operation will guard your sleep, the night mode turns off all lights & sounds. 8-hour timer saves energy - your unit works only when you need it. Auto shut off function (when out of water) is added for your peace of mind. Energy saving technology will save you money on power bills. CONGESTION, COLD RELIEF / SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: The home and office humidifier will help you wake up energetic & healthy. Combat symptoms of allergy & colds. Put an end to an itchy throat & nose, dry skin, congested sinuses, stuffiness & headaches. Keep humidity over 40% to feel relaxed & concentrated. Make sure dry air won't ruin your musical instruments, floors & furniture. Help your indoor garden bloom. This humidifier for a large room comes with a 1-YEAR WARRANTY & Support from HuPro!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718G7m+0siL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hupro","source_asin":"B07YC1FK3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-598959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YC1FK3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YC1FK3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
